<title>FRANCE: Club Med Q1 turnover rises.</title>
<headline>Club Med Q1 turnover rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter from November 1, 1996 to January 31.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover				   1,750,366    vs 1,648,766</p>
<p>NOTE - The French holiday group released the figures on Friday in the official bulletin Balo.</p>
